{"counts":{"canonical":10,"context":0,"total":10,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Archaeological Site of Mehrgarh","泥砖","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5772d60dd6f8b81bb35ec734","summary":"梅赫尔格尔位于今巴基斯坦俾路支省的卡奇平原，靠近博兰山口和博兰河。这里保存了跨公元前第七至第三千纪的长期考古序列，地层深逾十一米。多代居民反复营建泥砖建筑，旧屋遗存被新建筑覆盖，逐渐累积成今天看到的聚落土丘。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第七至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-7000},"title":"梅赫尔格尔群体连续营建泥砖聚落"},{"aliases":["Early Plains Archaic","食物","环境适应"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["北美大平原"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-4070732f6deb2a7d3d2c2708","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4070732f6deb2a7d3d2c2708","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-8f147befdcb86f09bb7979b3","summary":"约公元前5600至前3000年，北美大平原早期古风时期的人群仍大量依赖野牛，同时更常利用鱼类、鸟类和浆果。当地生计并非始终不变：早期猎人已经发展出步行协作驱赶猎物及使用投射工具的办法，河谷和草原的不同资源也共同进入食物来源。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5600年—公元前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5600},"title":"北美大平原早期古风时期的食物利用"},{"aliases":["The Ubaid Period (5500–4000 B.C.)","灌溉","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["两河流域"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-716ecc9c02fe599e72ce3b0b","images":[{"caption":"乌拜德文化陶碗，约公元前第六千纪中叶至第五千纪。大都会艺术博物馆藏，编号49.133.9。","creator":"摄影者未单列；馆藏影像提供：The Metropolitan Museum of Art","credit":"The Metropolitan Museum of Art；Rogers Fund, by exchange, 1949；CC0 1.0","depiction_type":"museum_object_photograph","license":"CC0 1.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","obligations":[],"rights_revision_url":null,"sha256":"57bfd6fd03c221ee595a7bdca8155f6d6c7dd38e9dbfae7372a76f91f20ce601","source_url":"https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/324093","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-57bfd6fd03c221ee595a7bdca8155f6d6c7dd38e9dbfae7372a76f91f20ce601.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-716ecc9c02fe599e72ce3b0b","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5b8b4cbdcc5979e68f7cab2d","summary":"约公元前5500至前4000年，两河流域许多地区共享乌拜德文化，其名称来自发现相关遗存的地点。南部冲积平原的居民利用灌溉耕种土地，同时在河流和波斯湾捕鱼。具有特色的陶器把分散聚落联系在共同的物质文化范围之中。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5500—前4000年","end_year":-4000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5500},"title":"乌拜德村落实行灌溉农业并出现城镇聚落"},{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Kitakogane Site","渔业","贝丘","居住"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ed76ae8247c548adbfb267a6","summary":"北黄金遗址位于北海道西南部内浦湾东岸的台地，考古范围约从公元前5000年延续至前2000年。聚落包含竖穴住居、墓葬、贝丘和用水地点。大量贝壳、鱼骨与海兽骨表明，当地居民充分利用沿海水域，以捕鱼和其他海洋资源获取为重要生计。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"北黄金居民以渔业为重要生计并营建聚落"},{"aliases":["人面鱼纹彩陶盆","彩陶","图像"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-f2285c47e34d4ce2713c9acb","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f2285c47e34d4ce2713c9acb","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ac86e5c4cd7aa0d4b198e69e","summary":"半坡人面鱼纹彩陶盆以红色陶胎和黑彩构成鲜明对比：盆内壁绘有两组相对的人面鱼纹，鱼的头部和人嘴轮廓彼此结合，另有鱼纹穿插其间。人物的眼、鼻及头部装饰被简化为明确的线条，使自然形象转化成带有想象力的装饰构图。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-5000},"title":"半坡人面鱼纹彩陶盆"},{"aliases":["transitional period","农业","城市起源"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["印度河文明"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-acead5667bb162fd5c75046c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-acead5667bb162fd5c75046c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cdef436efdb8ba9b018a1331","summary":"约公元前5000至前2600年，印度河地区的一些农业聚落逐渐扩大，呈现从村落迈向城镇的变化。考古发现中，住宅和道路的布局更为清楚，聚落也常靠近适于耕作的土地或便利交换的地点。相似器物在较大区域内出现，反映不同社区之间的联系不断增多。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000年—公元前2600年","end_year":-2600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"印度河地区迈向城市文明"},{"aliases":["Lacquered artefacts at Hemudu","漆器","工艺","考古断代"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-28e93c5975b9e741f09f4a84","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-28e93c5975b9e741f09f4a84","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-a660dc1725ab5b9ab08a5910","summary":"河姆渡文化层出土的漆器，是长江下游早期利用天然漆的实物线索。所引研究将相关地层置于约公元前5000至前4000年，并把它同田螺山、跨湖桥等地的早期漆器一起讨论。天然漆能够附着于木、竹或陶器表面，兼有保护材料和改变外观的作用。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前4000年","end_year":-4000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-5000},"title":"河姆渡文化层的早期漆器"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Yangshao (painted pottery) culture","考古","制陶"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["黄河流域新石器文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-9cbeae08566b87e98af368ec","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"region_reference","label":"黄河","latitude":36.12419444444444,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":116.09766666666667,"note":"本条所引原文明确涉及黄河；地图采用资料支持的地点范围，不表示精确场址或完整路线。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"region","role":"材料涉及地点","source_title":"Wikidata Q7355 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q7355&oldid=2541774085"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-9cbeae08566b87e98af368ec","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3db213eb11777bf0eb2fa84d","summary":"约公元前5000至前3000年，黄河中游分布着以彩陶和村落遗存著称的仰韶文化。考古学家通过陶器形制、纹饰以及房屋、墓葬的组合辨认不同遗址的联系。大量粟作村落、石制工具和制作精细的陶器，显示当地人群已经形成较稳定的农业生活。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000年—公元前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"黄河中游的仰韶文化"}],"revision":"21b67d3c98a7c70b1c04875f08dca3b74dd0cbcb50a3001b1f8a5a9a7a572549","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}